le breakdown\nSupports immune function"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"K Dairy\nNo sugar added\nGluten free"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No sugar added"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No banned substances detected"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"NSF Certified for sport"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Individual serving"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Instantized powder"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, add one packet (33 g) to 8 fl oz of water or milk (dairy, almond, oat, rice or soy) and mix or shake until smooth. For best results, liquid should be very cold. Mixes instantly without the use of a blender. For Extreme results, take approximately 30 minutes after workout."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Extreme Edge Whey Protein Isolate is designed to be one of the cleanest, purest and most natural whey protein isolate protein powders ever created."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"After an intense workout, your body needs high-quality protein to support muscle growth and development, as well as rapid muscle repair so that you can work out the next day with the same innate power and strength as the day before."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Whey protein isolate has the highest biological value of any protein source on the market and is fast-acting – meaning its amino acids are quickly and easily broken down in the body for immediate use for bigger and more intense gains."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Use it once, and you will never train without it again!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Key features\nProvides the highest biological value (159) of any other protein source"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Derived from free-roaming, grass-fed cows not treated with rBGH/antibiotics\nFree of artificially-derived colors, flavors, and sweeteners"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Microfiltered"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"98% lactose free"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Tested Certified Safer with NSF Certified for Sport\nProduct tested for 200+ banned substances. Product checked against sports prohibitive lists (NFL, MLB). More info at www.nsf.org"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"The Federal Government has determined there is no significant compositional difference in the milk or milk by-products from rBST or rBGH treated and untreated cows."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"1828C"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Notice: Use this product as a food supplement. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains: Milk"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Milk"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Free of Egg, Fish, Crustacean Shellfish, Tree Nuts, Peanuts, Wheat and Soybeans.\nAlso Free of Yeast, Gluten, Barley and Rice."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Allergen Warning: Manufactured in a facility that processes products containing milk, eggs, soybeans, wheat, shellfish, fish oil, tree nuts and peanut flavor."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Other products from Extreme Edge:\n1 Pre Workout\nMuscle recharging stack\n2 Carbo Load\nMuscle replenishing & refueling stack\n3 Post Workout\nMuscle rebuilding & recovery stack"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"Professional strength for serious athletes"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content",